{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "14466404",
      "title": "Resolving Data Before Loading",
      "lectureOrder": 609,
      "videoOrder": 561,
      "sourceHash": "8de253a945a814ee3477a633f065de9087eb2e9a57acea6249762456b605ab00",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.13,
          "end": 3.87,
          "en": "Instructor: We're almost done for the section",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.87,
          "end": 7.08,
          "en": "but we have another bug, or not really a bug",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.08,
          "end": 9.36,
          "en": "but a behavior which I wanna get rid of.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.36,
          "end": 12,
          "en": "If we are on a recipe detail page like this here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12,
          "end": 16.14,
          "en": "recipes slash two and you reload, you get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 16.14,
          "end": 17.707,
          "en": "You get an error that it can't read",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.707,
          "end": 19.41,
          "en": "the property ingredients of undefined.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.41,
          "end": 21.48,
          "en": "And the bigger problem here is not related",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.48,
          "end": 23.04,
          "en": "to the ingredients, but simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 23.04,
          "end": 25.32,
          "en": "that we try to load the detail page",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 25.32,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "for a recipe which doesn't exist,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 31.74,
          "en": "because we're fetching our recipes from a backend.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.74,
          "end": 35.55,
          "en": "And if we haven't pressed fetch data before",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 35.55,
          "end": 37.71,
          "en": "well then we simply have no recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.71,
          "end": 41.7,
          "en": "So accessing the details of our recipe is doomed to fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.7,
          "end": 45.9,
          "en": "Now there are different ways of making this work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 45.9,
          "end": 49.44,
          "en": "One of course would be to simply add a guard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 49.44,
          "end": 52.59,
          "en": "that prevents us from accessing recipes slash two",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.59,
          "end": 56.61,
          "en": "or the added route, which also has a an ID encoded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 56.61,
          "end": 57.69,
          "en": "in the URL.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 57.69,
          "end": 59.16,
          "en": "When we have no recipes loaded",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 59.16,
          "end": 63.03,
          "en": "and instead redirects us to just slash recipes for example.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 63.03,
          "end": 64.65,
          "en": "That would be one way of doing it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.65,
          "end": 66.45,
          "en": "We could use such a guard.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 66.45,
          "end": 69.33,
          "en": "But we can also use well yet a guard,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 69.33,
          "end": 72.24,
          "en": "but another type of guard we can use a resolver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 72.24,
          "end": 75.12,
          "en": "which are also covered in the routing module.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 75.12,
          "end": 77.76,
          "en": "A resolver is essentially some code that runs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 77.76,
          "end": 80.07,
          "en": "before a route is loaded to ensure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 80.07,
          "end": 83.64,
          "en": "that certain data that the route depends on is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 83.64,
          "end": 86.49,
          "en": "That sounds like a good idea to me.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 86.49,
          "end": 88.14,
          "en": "I'll add it in the recipes folder",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 88.14,
          "end": 89.58,
          "en": "next to the recipes component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 89.58,
          "end": 91.41,
          "en": "And I'll name it the file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 91.41,
          "end": 96.41,
          "en": "I'll name the file recipes resolver dot service dot ts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 97.59,
          "end": 99.81,
          "en": "because it is a normal Angular service in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 99.81,
          "end": 101.19,
          "en": "In there, let's export a class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 101.19,
          "end": 105.063,
          "en": "which should be named Recipes Resolver Service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 108.15,
          "end": 112.12,
          "en": "And this will get the @ injectable decorator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 113.19,
          "end": 115.5,
          "en": "because it is injectable in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 115.5,
          "end": 119.221,
          "en": "And injectable as you learn, needs to be imported from",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 119.221,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "@Angular core.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 126.8,
          "en": "And this will then get the provided in root object here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 127.11,
          "end": 129.873,
          "en": "to provided application wide automatically.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 131.55,
          "end": 134.193,
          "en": "Now the Recipes Resolver Service,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 135.39,
          "end": 140.39,
          "en": "now needs to implement the resolve interface.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 140.57999999999998,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "Now resolve is also imported from an Angular package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 148.743,
          "en": "of course, is imported from @Angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.85,
          "end": 152.94,
          "en": "Now resolve is a generic interface, which means we need to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 152.94,
          "end": 155.79,
          "en": "define which type of data will resolve in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 160.79,
          "en": "And in our case, that will be the recipe data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 161.82,
          "end": 163.53,
          "en": "So in the array of recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 163.53,
          "end": 166.89,
          "en": "And for that lets also import recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.89,
          "end": 170.52,
          "en": "from the recipe model here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 170.52,
          "end": 171.84,
          "en": "So our resolver will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 171.84,
          "end": 174.453,
          "en": "in the end run some code that loads some recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 177.69,
          "end": 180.63,
          "en": "We now need to inject our data storage service here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 180.63,
          "end": 184.02,
          "en": "because that is the service that will make the HDP request.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.02,
          "end": 187.5,
          "en": "So I'll name it Data storage service here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 187.5,
          "end": 191.16,
          "en": "of type data storage service, which now also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 191.16,
          "end": 193.563,
          "en": "needs to be imported up there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 196.38,
          "end": 198.66,
          "en": "from the shared folder.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 198.66,
          "end": 200.733,
          "en": "And there the data storage service file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 201.9,
          "end": 204.57,
          "en": "And now the resolve interface forces us to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.57,
          "end": 207.03,
          "en": "add a resolve method here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 207.03,
          "end": 209.01,
          "en": "which gets data about the route,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 209.01,
          "end": 211.65,
          "en": "the activated route snapshot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.65,
          "end": 214.2,
          "en": "which is imported from the Angular router",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 214.2,
          "end": 217.07999999999998,
          "en": "and which gets the current routing state",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 217.07999999999998,
          "end": 219.78,
          "en": "which is of type router state snapshot",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.78,
          "end": 222.273,
          "en": "which is all imported from @Angular router.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 223.71,
          "end": 225.27,
          "en": "From there we could get information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 225.27,
          "end": 228.06,
          "en": "like the ID we're requesting, but I'm not interested.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 228.06,
          "end": 230.16,
          "en": "I want to load all recipes anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 230.16,
          "end": 233.07,
          "en": "Otherwise things like editing them won't work correctly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 233.07,
          "end": 234.6,
          "en": "because we need to re-insert them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.6,
          "end": 236.19,
          "en": "into the array and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.19,
          "end": 237.633,
          "en": "and therefore now here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 238.56,
          "end": 242.07,
          "en": "the goal is to return either an array of recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 242.07,
          "end": 244.56,
          "en": "which we can't because we need to load it first,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 244.56,
          "end": 246.42,
          "en": "or an observable that will",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.42,
          "end": 248.94,
          "en": "in the end yield an array of recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 248.94,
          "end": 250.65,
          "en": "And that is something different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 250.65,
          "end": 252.63,
          "en": "That is something we can offer.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 252.63,
          "end": 255.27,
          "en": "For that, let's have a look at the data storage service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 255.27,
          "end": 256.89,
          "en": "There, we have fetch recipes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 256.89,
          "end": 258.87,
          "en": "and right now we subscribe in here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 258.87,
          "end": 261.21,
          "en": "We just have to tweak this a little bit.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 261.21,
          "end": 264.81,
          "en": "I still want to set the recipes in the recipe service",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 264.81,
          "end": 267.78,
          "en": "from inside fetch recipes, but we can simply do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 267.78,
          "end": 271.62,
          "en": "by adding another RX js operator, the TAP operator",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 271.62,
          "end": 274.17,
          "en": "and the TAP operator also needs to be imported",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 274.17,
          "end": 276.48,
          "en": "from RX js operators.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 276.48,
          "end": 279.24,
          "en": "The TAP operator allows us to execute some code here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 279.24,
          "end": 282.63,
          "en": "in place without altering the data that is funneled",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 282.63,
          "end": 284.19,
          "en": "through that observable.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 284.19,
          "end": 286.17,
          "en": "So in here we will get our recipes array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 286.17,
          "end": 288.9,
          "en": "indeed and I will simply set the recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 288.9,
          "end": 290.88,
          "en": "in a service then, as before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 290.88,
          "end": 293.15999999999997,
          "en": "But now I will not subscribe here anymore",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 293.15999999999997,
          "end": 298.15999999999997,
          "en": "but instead return this call to this HTB service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 298.47,
          "end": 301.59,
          "en": "And that means that in the header component, we now",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 301.59,
          "end": 303.6,
          "en": "have to subscribe here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 303.6,
          "end": 305.7,
          "en": "And you don't even have to pass in a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 305.7,
          "end": 307.723,
          "en": "if you're not caring about the response anyways.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 307.723,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "So therefore here in the header component, this change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 312.99,
          "en": "of course is a bit redundant, but it's now really",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 312.99,
          "end": 314.88,
          "en": "helpful here in the resolve method.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 314.88,
          "end": 318.21,
          "en": "Because here we can now return this data storage",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 318.21,
          "end": 320.22,
          "en": "service, fetch recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 320.22,
          "end": 322.8,
          "en": "Now please note that I'm not subscribing here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 322.8,
          "end": 326.34,
          "en": "but I'm simply not subscribing here because the resolver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 326.34,
          "end": 328.86,
          "en": "this Angular feature will subscribe for me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 328.86,
          "end": 332.433,
          "en": "to basically find out once the data is there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 333.33,
          "end": 334.56,
          "en": "You can ignore this error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 334.56,
          "end": 337.95,
          "en": "It's my IDE not understanding that this is valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 337.95,
          "end": 341.34000000000003,
          "en": "So now we should have a valid resolver that loads the data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 341.34000000000003,
          "end": 344.07,
          "en": "before this page is loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 344.07,
          "end": 345.693,
          "en": "So let's now fetch data,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 346.83,
          "end": 348.693,
          "en": "open the summer, sell it and reload.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 349.53,
          "end": 351.06,
          "en": "And we still fail.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 351.06,
          "end": 354.12,
          "en": "Now obviously because we're not applying the resolver.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 354.12,
          "end": 356.73,
          "en": "So let's now go to the app routing module where",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 356.73,
          "end": 361.2,
          "en": "we have our two pops that rely on our recipe being loaded.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 361.2,
          "end": 365.85,
          "en": "And on both these pops we now have to add the resolve key",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 365.85,
          "end": 367.59,
          "en": "which is an array of resolvers.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 367.59,
          "end": 372.59,
          "en": "And there we should add our recipes, resolver service.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 373.17,
          "end": 375.12,
          "en": "And that now needs to be imported.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 375.12,
          "end": 377.73,
          "en": "So let's import recipes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 377.73,
          "end": 382.73,
          "en": "resolver service from dot slash recipes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 383.25,
          "end": 386.97,
          "en": "And then there it's that recipe resolver service file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 386.97,
          "end": 388.83,
          "en": "Now let's add that same key.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 388.83,
          "end": 391.68,
          "en": "Whoops, that same key here, to the recipe added component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 391.68,
          "end": 393.84000000000003,
          "en": "And now Angular will run this resolver",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
